# Applies to every build whose context is the repo root. That is now three
# images: the control-plane (needs control-plane/ + the top-level policies/ seed)
# and BOTH sandbox tiers (claude-sandbox/ and opencode-sandbox/, each of which
# also needs the shared sandbox-common/ scripts). The sandbox images use a root
# context precisely so they can COPY sandbox-common/ — a build context cannot
# reach outside itself, and the firewall must have ONE implementation, not a copy
# per tier. The egress proxy uses its own context (proxies/egress), unaffected.
#
# Keep the root context small: exclude anything no root-context image needs.
.git
.github
control-plane-ui
proxies
tests
models
run-claude-sandbox.sh
run-opencode-sandbox.sh
sandbox-lib.sh
Makefile
*.md
.env
.hadolint.yaml
.shellcheckrc
.yamllint
__pycache__
.ruff_cache
# Host-local state that the Makefile keeps OUT of the tree by default, listed for the
# hand-run case that lands it here anyway. Nothing COPYs these today, and the point
# is that a future `COPY . .` cannot start to.
backups
secrets
.claude
